original definitions. `row_of_values` keeps those lookup equalities separate
from the XOR calculation, avoiding repeated reduction of the same closed
arrays during each column proof. Its five scalar premises are discharged in
all 600 applications in `Columns`.

Source application: Aschbacher–Smith G.7.3(2), printed p.348/PDF p.359.
